{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 756150,
  "courseSlug": "the-complete-guide-to-angular-2",
  "courseTitle": "Angular - The Complete Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "43788616",
      "title": "Dynamic CSS Styling with Class Bindings",
      "lectureOrder": 49,
      "videoOrder": 45,
      "sourceHash": "13c3ceb7d021641725fe55977ce09d0f314fc348feff38161a54240482fd3048",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.66,
          "end": 4.89,
          "en": "So now we're able to select different users",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.89,
          "end": 6.66,
          "en": "and see their tasks.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.66,
          "end": 8.46,
          "en": "But, of course, the Add Task",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.46,
          "end": 11.1,
          "en": "and Complete buttons don't do anything yet,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.1,
          "end": 13.86,
          "en": "and that's therefore what we'll add next.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.86,
          "end": 15.54,
          "en": "However, before we do that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 15.54,
          "end": 19.106,
          "en": "there's one other improvement I'd like to make",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.106,
          "end": 21.3,
          "en": "on this application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 21.3,
          "end": 25.98,
          "en": "I'd like to make it very clear which user was selected.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.98,
          "end": 28.2,
          "en": "Sure, we can see the name here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.2,
          "end": 30.3,
          "en": "but if we scroll down, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 30.3,
          "end": 32.91,
          "en": "we don't really see it anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 32.91,
          "end": 36.54,
          "en": "And it would simply be nice if the currently active user",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 36.54,
          "end": 39.24,
          "en": "would be highlighted here on the left,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 39.24,
          "end": 43.74,
          "en": "and we can implement this feature by going",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 43.74,
          "end": 48.15,
          "en": "to the user.component.html file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48.15,
          "end": 52.2,
          "en": "or to the user.component.css file actually first.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 52.2,
          "end": 56.61,
          "en": "And in there, you'll see that I prepared a CSS class,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 56.61,
          "end": 60.75,
          "en": "an active class that could be added to an element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 60.75,
          "end": 62.973,
          "en": "to give it this highlighted look.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 64.2,
          "end": 68.67,
          "en": "So in order to make a user look highlighted",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 68.67,
          "end": 73.67,
          "en": "and selected, we should conditionally add that CSS class",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 74.52,
          "end": 79.47,
          "en": "to that button here if the user is selected.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 79.47,
          "end": 82.08,
          "en": "Therefore, as a first step, we need",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 82.08,
          "end": 87.06,
          "en": "to find out whether a user is selected or not,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 87.06,
          "end": 89.16,
          "en": "and we actually already have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 89.16,
          "end": 92.61,
          "en": "that information in the app.component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 92.61,
          "end": 97.533,
          "en": "There we know which user with which ID is selected,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 99.12,
          "end": 102.393,
          "en": "and we then even compute the selectedUser like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 103.8,
          "end": 107.91,
          "en": "Therefore, to implement this highlighting feature,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 107.91,
          "end": 111.87,
          "en": "we can go back to the user.component TypeScript file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 111.87,
          "end": 115.97999999999999,
          "en": "and add another new input here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 115.97999999999999,
          "end": 119.28999999999999,
          "en": "an input property that I'll name selected",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 120.24,
          "end": 122.85,
          "en": "and the type should be boolean.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 122.85,
          "end": 124.983,
          "en": "So true or false,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 126.99,
          "end": 130.98,
          "en": "I also wanna make this required",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 130.98,
          "end": 134.28,
          "en": "so that it must be set and therefore,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 134.28,
          "end": 135.93,
          "en": "I can add this exclamation mark",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 135.93,
          "end": 138.933,
          "en": "to convince TypeScript that this will be set.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 139.89,
          "end": 143.433,
          "en": "Now, back in the app.component template,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 144.36,
          "end": 148.77,
          "en": "we have to add this selected property here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 148.77,
          "end": 151.44,
          "en": "and set it equal to true or false.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 151.44,
          "end": 154.41,
          "en": "And of course, I wanna dynamically derive whether it's true",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 154.41,
          "end": 159.15,
          "en": "or false, and that's fairly straightforward to do",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 159.15,
          "end": 160.2,
          "en": "because as mentioned,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 160.2,
          "end": 165.2,
          "en": "we're storing the selectedUserId here in the app.component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 165.21,
          "end": 168,
          "en": "And in the app.component template,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 168,
          "end": 170.82,
          "en": "we're looping through all users.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 170.82,
          "end": 173.49,
          "en": "So selected will be true if the ID",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 173.49,
          "end": 177.03,
          "en": "of the user we're currently looking at in this loop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 177.03,
          "end": 180.29,
          "en": "is equal to that selectedUserId.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 181.926,
          "end": 183.87,
          "en": "And otherwise, we'll get false here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 183.87,
          "end": 186.66,
          "en": "because it's then not the selected user",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 186.66,
          "end": 187.863,
          "en": "we're outputting here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 189.18,
          "end": 192.81,
          "en": "But with that, we're passing this selected property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 192.81,
          "end": 196.35,
          "en": "or this value for this selected property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 196.35,
          "end": 198.393,
          "en": "to this user.component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 199.65,
          "end": 203.46,
          "en": "Now we can use this selected property in the template",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 203.46,
          "end": 208.46,
          "en": "of this user.component to conditionally add that CSS class.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 209.79,
          "end": 214.29,
          "en": "And if you wanna add a class conditionally to an element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 214.29,
          "end": 217.74,
          "en": "which is a rather common scenario, you can do that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 217.74,
          "end": 222.74,
          "en": "with a special binding, a special property binding syntax.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 223.65,
          "end": 227.22,
          "en": "Instead of binding the class property as a whole,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 227.22,
          "end": 229.167,
          "en": "you bind class.,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 230.25,
          "end": 233.88,
          "en": "and then the name of the class you wanna conditionally add,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 233.88,
          "end": 235.383,
          "en": "for example, active.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 236.22,
          "end": 240.27,
          "en": "And then you set this equal to a true or false value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 240.27,
          "end": 243.96,
          "en": "which determines whether this class will be added.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 243.96,
          "end": 246.96,
          "en": "So in this case, the selected property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 246.96,
          "end": 248.943,
          "en": "which holds true or false.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 250.74,
          "end": 252.15,
          "en": "And that's all.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 252.15,
          "end": 255.21,
          "en": "With that, this active CSS class is added",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 255.21,
          "end": 257.763,
          "en": "to this button if selected is true.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 259.5,
          "end": 262.83,
          "en": "If we save that, you see initially nothing's selected,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 262.83,
          "end": 266.22,
          "en": "but if I click on a user, now you see it stays",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 266.22,
          "end": 269.61,
          "en": "in that highlighted mode, not just when I hover over it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 269.61,
          "end": 271.503,
          "en": "but also after I clicked on it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 272.4,
          "end": 274.83299999999997,
          "en": "And that's now the behavior I want here.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
